{
    "test_name": "MOB.135_Work_Form_Signature_Pad",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.135_Work_Form_Signature_Pad",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.135` **A tablet signs a form's signature field in the desktop grid.**\n- The 768-wide tablet takes the desktop grid, which now draws signature fields with the\n  MOBILE control: `\ud83d\udd0e Inspection`'s `Add a signature label` renders as a `.mobile-signature-cell` with\n  `Add Signature`, which opens the pad in a modal.\n- \u2b50 Closed without drawing, the pad saves NOTHING \u2014 proved over /graphql. The pad reports only\n  a finished stroke or `Clear`, and the field saves only what is pending, on close.\n- \ud83d\uded1 `Clear` is never clicked (it would queue a null save). Drawing and saving a signature is\n  left out: it would sign the fixture's form \u2014 an owner decision.\n- Read-only.",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Work Order",
            "Forms",
            "read-only"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
        "config": {
            "assertions": [],
            "config_variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "headers": {},
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{ MOBDEV }}"
            },
            "variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "set_cookie": ""
        },
